        "description": "A professional's reviews: rating, text, relationship, project date and price, dates, likes, author, photos and the professional's replies. 20 a page; pass `next_page` back as `page` (null on the last page). Pass `user_id` and `pro_id` (from search or profile results), or a profile `url`.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/houzz-reviews",
